AttestationSigil::supportsInterface
├── given the IERC165 interface id
│   └── it should return true
├── given the ISigilBase interface id
│   └── it should return true
├── given the I1271Sigil interface id
│   └── it should return true
├── given the IActionSigil interface id
│   └── it should return false
└── given an unknown interface id
    └── it should return false
